  "description": "Everyone knows how the fairy tale ends. A true love's kiss awakens the slumbering Snow White, who then lives happily ever after with her prince. After all, main characters always get their happy endings.\n\nBut what happens to the evil queen after? Exiled to the isolated, bleak Northern island, she awaits her execution; thirty days of waiting, with only a nonchalant guard as company. If she is to live, she must find a way out. Will she be able to escape in time, defying all odds? Or will she succumb to fate?\n\n[Original Webtoon (CH.2)](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=733081)\n\n***Note:** Part of an anthology (Entry 2) in the Naver Webtoon's 2019 Rookie Short Story - Hell Camp (2019 루키 단편선-지옥캠프)*",
